OL,3,GNEWSAInfected dog prompts vaccination
OL,4,Awarning
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's States vet has advised dog
OL,7,Fowners to have their pets vaccinated
OL,8,Fafter one was infected with a
OL,9,Fpotentially fatal disease.
OL,11,FIt follows New Era Veterinary Hospital
OL,12,Fannouncing a case of leptospirosis had
OL,13,Fbeen confirmed in an unvaccinated dog
OL,14,Fon the island.
OL,16,FThe hospital said the bacterial
OL,17,Finfection can affect both animals and
OL,18,Fhumans.
OL,20,FJersey's States vet Susana Ramos said
OL,21,Fcases were "relatively infrequent" but
OL,22,Fare seen occasionally.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
